Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------

workflows/*.api.json
  Generated by scripts/build-workflows.ts from the official ComfyUI workflow
  templates in the `comfyui-workflow-templates` package (Comfy-Org), version
  0.11.76, License: MIT. Templates used: video_ltx2_5_i2v, video_ltx2_5_t2v,
  image_z_image_turbo, utility_seedvr2_3b_int8_upscale_video,
  utility_birefnet_remove_background. Changes: converted to the API format;
  output filename prefixes set; in the BiRefNet graph, the preview node is
  replaced by a save node.

Model weights are NOT included. Each workflow manifest (workflows/<id>.json)
names the files it needs, where the official template downloads them from,
and the licence of the weights:
  LTX-2.5            LTX-2 Community License (Lightricks)
  Z-Image-Turbo      Apache-2.0 (Tongyi-MAI)
  SeedVR2            Apache-2.0 (ByteDance Seed)
  BiRefNet           MIT
  Gemma 4 encoders   see the model card of the files the template downloads
Read each licence before using the outputs commercially.

